contentText:
José Iglesias is headed to Broadway. The MLB veteran and Latin pop singer, who records as Candelita, will join the musical  Buena Vista Social Club  as The Narrator from Aug. 27 to Oct. 4 for a six-week run. In doing so, he will become the first Latin Major League Baseball player to perform on Broadway.

